    "q-394147": {
      "dom_id": "step-q394147",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Given that the function $f(x)={x}^{6}-12x$ has a critical point in the interval $[1,2],$ use the Newton-Raphson process for optimization starting from ${x}_{0}=1.5$ to estimate the critical point. Round your final answer to two decimal places.",
      "worked_solution": "The Newton-Raphson process for optimization is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-\\frac{{f}^{′}({x}_{n})}{{f}^{″}({x}_{n})},\n$$\n\nwhere ${f}^{′}({x}_{n})$ and ${f}^{″}({x}_{n})$ are the first and second derivatives of $f(x)$ evaluated at ${x}_{n},$ respectively.\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{6}-12x)^{′}=6{x}^{5}-12, \\\\ {f}^{″}(x) & =(6{x}^{5}-12)^{′}=30{x}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson formula is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{n+1} & ={x}_{n}-\\frac{6{x}_{n}^{5}-12}{30{x}_{n}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}_{n}(30{x}_{n}^{4})-(6{x}_{n}^{5}-12)}{30{x}_{n}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{24{x}_{n}^{5}+12}{30{x}_{n}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nStarting with ${x}_{0}=1.5,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =\\frac{24{x}_{0}^{5}+12}{30{x}_{0}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{24(1.5)^{5}+12}{30(1.5)^{4}} \\\\  & =1.279\\,012…\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimilarly, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =\\frac{24{x}_{1}^{5}+12}{30{x}_{1}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{24(1.279\\,012…)^{5}+12}{30(1.279\\,012…)^{4}} \\\\  & =1.172\\,682…, \\\\ {x}_{3} & =\\frac{24{x}_{2}^{5}+12}{30{x}_{2}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{24(1.172\\,682…)^{5}+12}{30(1.172\\,682…)^{4}} \\\\  & =1.149\\,659…. \\\\ {x}_{4} & =\\frac{24{x}_{3}^{5}+12}{30{x}_{3}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{24(1.149\\,659…)^{5}+12}{30(1.149\\,659…)^{4}} \\\\  & =1.148\\,699….\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the last two approximations ${x}_{3}≈1.15$ and ${x}_{4}≈1.15$ are the same when rounded to two decimal places.\n\nTherefore, the critical point of the function is $x≈1.15,$ rounded to two decimal places.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-394147-a",
